"pos": "v.",
"meaning": "考虑，斟酌；认为，视为；体贴，顾及；细看，端详；探讨，讨论",
"translations": [
"v. 考虑，斟酌；认为，视为；体贴，顾及；细看，端详；探讨，讨论"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "We don't consider our customers to be mere consumers; we consider them to be our friends.",
"cn": "我们没有视我们的顾客为纯粹的消费者；我们视他们为我们的朋友。"
},
{
"en": "I had always considered myself a strong, competent woman.",
"cn": "我曾一直以为自己是个坚强能干的女人。"
},
{
"en": "The administration continues to consider ways to resolve the situation.",
"cn": "政府继续仔细考虑解决这种情况的办法。"
},
{
"en": "You do have to consider the feelings of those around you.",
"cn": "你真的得仔细考虑你身边那些人的感受。"
},
{
"en": "I had seriously considered telling the story from the point of view of the wives.",
"cn": "我曾认真考虑过从妻子们的角度来讲述这个故事。"
},
{
"en": "I'd like some time to <b>consider</b>.",
"cn": "我希望有些时间考虑一下。"
}
],
