"meaning": "害怕，畏惧；担心，忧虑；敬畏；恐惧；担心；（坏事发生的）可能性；敬畏",
"translations": [
"v. 害怕，畏惧；担心，忧虑；敬畏",
"n. 恐惧；担心；（坏事发生的）可能性；敬畏"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "I was sitting on the floor shivering with fear because a bullet had been fired through a window.",
"cn": "我坐在地板上吓得浑身发抖，因为有一颗子弹射穿窗户打了进来。"
},
{
"en": "These youngsters are motivated by fear of failure.",
"cn": "这些年轻人因担心失败而被激发。"
},
{
"en": "Then one day his worst fears were confirmed.",
"cn": "后来有一天，他最大的担心被证实了。"
},
{
"en": "There is a fear that the freeze on bank accounts could prove a lasting deterrent to investors.",
"cn": "冻结银行帐户很可能对投资者是一个长期的威慑因素。"
},
{
"en": "He also spoke of his fears for the future of his country's culture.",
"cn": "他也谈及了他对祖国文化前景的担忧。"
},
{
"en": "It seems to me that if people fear you they respect you.",
"cn": "在我看来，如果人们怕你，那他们就尊重你。"
}
],
