"pos": "v.",
"meaning": "想象，设想；料想，认为；误以为，胡乱猜想",
"translations": [
"v. 想象，设想；料想，认为；误以为，胡乱猜想"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "He could not imagine a more peaceful scene.",
"cn": "他想像不出比这更幽静的场景。"
},
{
"en": "I imagine you're referring to Jean-Paul Sartre.",
"cn": "我猜你指的是吉恩-保尔·萨特。"
},
{
"en": "Looking back on it now, I realized that I must have imagined the whole thing.",
"cn": "现在回想起来，我意识到这整个事情一定是我幻想出来的。"
},
{
"en": "I can just <b>imagine</b> his reaction.",
"cn": "我完全可以想象出他的反应。"
},
{
"en": "You can <b>imagine</b> he was terribly upset.",
"cn": "你能想像他有多苦恼。"
},
{
"en": "I can't <b>imagine</b> life without the children now.",
"cn": "我现在无法设想没有了孩子们的生活。"
}
],
