"pos": "v.",
"meaning": "建议，劝告 ；推荐，介绍；使显得吸引人，使受欢迎；<古> 把……交托给，把……托付给",
"translations": [
"v. 建议，劝告 ；推荐，介绍；使显得吸引人，使受欢迎；<古> 把……交托给，把……托付给"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "I just spent a holiday there and would recommend it to anyone.",
"cn": "我刚在那儿度过一个假期，愿意向任何人推荐那里。"
},
{
"en": "\"You're a good worker,\" he told him. \"I'll recommend you for a promotion.\"",
"cn": "“你是名好员工，”他说。“我要推荐你升职。”"
},
{
"en": "Though ten years old, this book is highly recommended.",
"cn": "尽管已出版10年了，这本书仍备受推崇。"
},
{
"en": "The judge recommended that he serve 20 years in prison.",
"cn": "法官建议判他入狱服刑20年。"
},
{
"en": "We strongly recommend reporting the incident to the police.",
"cn": "我们强烈建议将此事报警。"
},
{
"en": "La Cucina restaurant has much to recommend it.",
"cn": "拉库奇那餐馆有许多值得称道的地方。"
}
],
