"translations": [
"v. 确定，确认；证实，证明；批准，认可；使坚定，加强；给（某人）施坚信礼"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "X-rays have confirmed that he has not broken any bones.",
"cn": "X光片已经证实他没有骨折。"
},
{
"en": "They took her resignation as confirmation of their suspicions.",
"cn": "他们认为她的辞职证实了他们的猜疑。"
},
{
"en": "The spokesman confirmed that the area was now in rebel hands.",
"cn": "该发言人证实该地区现在处于反叛者的控制之中。"
},
{
"en": "She glanced over at James for confirmation.",
"cn": "她瞟了詹姆斯一眼寻求确认。"
},
{
"en": "You make the reservation, and I'll confirm it in writing.",
"cn": "你先预定，我再以书面形式确认。"
},
{
"en": "Travel arrangements are subject to confirmation by the head office.",
"cn": "旅行安排需经总公司确准。"
}
],
