"pos": "n.",
"meaning": "责任，负责；（对不良事件所负的）责任；（道义上或法律规定的）责任（responsibility to/towards）；职责，任务；重任，职权",
"translations": [
"n. 责任，负责；（对不良事件所负的）责任；（道义上或法律规定的）责任（responsibility to/towards）；职责，任务；重任，职权"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "Each manager had responsibility for just under 600 properties.",
"cn": "每位经理对差一点不到六百处房产负责。"
},
{
"en": "No one admitted responsibility for the attacks.",
"cn": "没有人对这些袭击负责。"
},
{
"en": "I am told that he handled his responsibilities as a counsellor in a highly intelligent and caring fashion.",
"cn": "我被告知，他以一种高度的智慧和富有同情心的方式对待他作为一名顾问的职责。"
},
{
"en": "She would have loved to have a better-paying job with more responsibility.",
"cn": "她本想有一份薪水更高职权更多的工作。"
},
{
"en": "The court feels it has a responsibility to ensure that customers are not misled.",
"cn": "该法院觉得其有责任确保消费者们不被误导。"
},
{
"en": "She had decided that as a doctor she had a responsibility to her fellow creatures.",
"cn": "她决定作为一名医生她对同胞们负有义务。"
}
],
