"pos": "v.",
"meaning": "不喜欢，厌恶；不喜欢，反感；不喜欢的事物",
"translations": [
"v. 不喜欢，厌恶",
"n. 不喜欢，反感；不喜欢的事物"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "Liver is a great favourite of his and we don't serve it often because so many people dislike it.",
"cn": "肝脏是他的一种最爱，但我们不常供应这道菜，因为有那么多人不爱吃。"
},
{
"en": "My dislike of thunder and even small earthquakes was due to Mother.",
"cn": "我对雷声甚至于轻微地震的厌恶都归因于我的母亲。"
},
{
"en": "Consider what your likes and dislikes are about your job.",
"cn": "考虑一下，对于你的工作哪些是你喜欢的，哪些是不喜欢的。"
},
{
"en": "He may suddenly take a dislike to foods that he's previously enjoyed.",
"cn": "他也许会突然讨厌他以前喜欢吃的食物。"
},
{
"en": "Why do you <b>dislike</b> him so much?",
"cn": "你为什么那么讨厌他呢？"
},
{
"en": "I took a violent <b>dislike</b> to him.",
"cn": "我很讨厌他。"
}
],
