"pos": "v.",
"meaning": "保卫，防御；捍卫，维护；（在比赛中）防守，防卫；参加卫冕赛，蝉联；做……的辩护律师，为……辩解",
"translations": [
"v. 保卫，防御；捍卫，维护；（在比赛中）防守，防卫；参加卫冕赛，蝉联；做……的辩护律师，为……辩解"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "His courage in defending religious and civil rights inspired many outside the church.",
"cn": "他捍卫宗教权和公民权的勇气鼓舞了许多非教会人士。"
},
{
"en": "He defended his administration's response to the disaster against critics who charge the federal government is moving too slowly.",
"cn": "他为他的行政部门对灾难的反应做了争辩，反驳批评人士指控联邦政府行动过于迟缓。"
},
{
"en": "...a lawyer who defended political prisoners during the military regime.",
"cn": "…一位在军权时期为政治犯进行辩护的律师。"
},
{
"en": "He has hired a lawyer to defend him against the allegation.",
"cn": "他已聘请一位律师为他所受的指控辩护。"
},
{
"en": "Torrence expects to defend her title successfully in the next Olympics.",
"cn": "托伦斯希望下届奥运会能成功卫冕。"
},
{
"en": "The newspaper continues to <b>defend</b> its publication of the photographs.",
"cn": "这家报纸继续为刊登这些照片辩护。"
}
],
