"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "After the second explosion, all of London's main train and subway stations were shut down.",
"cn": "第二次爆炸后，伦敦所有的主要火车站及地铁站都被关闭了。"
},
{
"en": "Bomb disposal experts blew up the bag in a controlled explosion.",
"cn": "拆弹专家在一次控制爆破中炸掉了那个袋子。"
},
{
"en": "The study also forecast an explosion in the diet soft-drink market.",
"cn": "这项研究还预测了低糖软饮料市场的暴增。"
},
{
"en": "Every time they met, Myra anticipated an explosion.",
"cn": "每次他们相见，迈拉都预期会有一场怒火暴发。"
},
{
"en": "...the explosion of protest and violence sparked off by the killing of seven workers.",
"cn": "…由7名工人被杀引起的抗议及暴力行为的爆发。"
},
{
"en": "She was blinded in the <b>explosion</b>.",
"cn": "她在那场爆炸中双目失明了。"
}
],
