"translations": [
"n. 差异，对比；对照物，明显不同的事物；（摄影或绘画中的）颜色反差，明暗对比；（电视屏幕的）图像明暗对比度，反差",
"v. 对比，对照；显出明显的差异，形成对比"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "...the contrast between town and country.",
"cn": "…城乡差别。"
},
{
"en": "The two visitors provided a startling contrast in appearance.",
"cn": "两位来访者的外貌有惊人的不同。"
},
{
"en": "The private sector, by contrast, has plenty of money to spend.",
"cn": "私营部门相比之下有很多钱可花。"
},
{
"en": "In contrast, the lives of girls in well-to-do families were often very sheltered.",
"cn": "相比之下，富裕家庭的女孩子们通常都过着养尊处优的生活。"
},
{
"en": "His public statements have always been in marked contrast to those of his son.",
"cn": "他在公共场合的发言总是和他儿子的话截然不同。"
},
{
"en": "She contrasted the situation then with the present crisis.",
"cn": "她把过去的情况与现在的危机进行了对比。"
}
],
