"translations": [
"adj. 不友善的，不亲切的；刻薄的；（天气、命运、境遇等）恶劣的，无情的，不利的"
],
"en_defs": [],
"examples": [
{
"en": "All last summer he'd been unkind to her.",
"cn": "去年整个夏天他都对她不友好。"
},
{
"en": "No one has an unkind word to say about him.",
"cn": "没人用不善之辞谈论过他。"
},
{
"en": "Several viewers commented unkindly on her costumes.",
"cn": "几个观众恶评了她的戏装。"
},
{
"en": "The weather was unkind to those pipers who played in the morning.",
"cn": "天气对那些早晨吹奏管乐器者来说并不妙。"
},
{
"en": "It's not in his nature to be <b>unkind</b>.",
"cn": "他天生不会刻薄。"
},
{
"en": "He was never actually <b>unkind</b> to them.",
"cn": "其实他从没有对他们不好。"
}
],
